{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-ee7e47c9f4db4a716e60","statement":"The (monodromic) affine Deligne-Lusztig induction $\\Ch_{LG,\\phi}^{\\mon}$ (see <<ref:eq: monodromic ADLI>>) induces an equivalence\n\n\\begin{equation}\n\\tr(\\shv_{\\mon}(\\iw^u\\backslash LG/\\iw^u), \\phi)\\cong \\shv^{\\tame}(\\kot_G),\n\\end{equation}\n\nThe unipotent affine Deligne-Lusztig induction $\\Ch_{LG,\\phi}^{\\unip}$ (see <<ref:eq: unipotent ADLI>>) induces an equivalence\n\n\\begin{equation}\n\\tr(\\rshv(\\iw\\backslash LG/\\iw),\\phi)\\cong \\rshv^{\\unip}(\\kot_G,\\La).\n\\end{equation}\n\nThe above equivalences restrict to equivalences\n\n\\begin{equation}\n\\tr(\\shv\\bigl((\\iw,\\hat{u})\\backslash LG/(\\iw, \\hat{u}\\bigr), \\phi)\\cong \\shv^{\\widehat{\\unip}}(\\kot_G,\\La)\\cong \\tr(\\shv(\\iw\\backslash LG/\\iw),\\phi).\n\\end{equation}","source_id":"arXiv:2504.07482","cluster":"representation_theory","statement_sha256":"9a0d9704189ca2fc271b5eae2c9dfe2cc8b4a494e0424482982c1f0a3c3f1a3a","kind":"theorem","label":"Theorem 348","ref_key":"prop: tame llc as a categorical trace","name":"","order":502,"deps":[{"ref":"eq: monodromic ADLI","card_id":"ma-c-0a47cf0ca71f4cae3bbe","label":"Equation  monodromic ADLI","resolved":true,"target":"card"},{"ref":"eq: unipotent ADLI","card_id":"ma-c-03d76ef3c833fca7a19e","label":"Equation  unipotent ADLI","resolved":true,"target":"card"}],"cite_keys":[],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.07482","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"1b700e8c4a2fc6f0c0f522039f223820ba6737a9a0ac91aea37c58ba7a3389c2","line":10372,"origin":"latex_env","retrieved_at":"2026-09-28T11:10:54+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v3","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":702,"math_hints":71}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:2504.07482","title":"Tame categorical local Langlands correspondence","abstract":"In one of our previous articles, we outl